## STEP 4 — IMPROVEMENT ROADMAP

### PHASE 1 — Quick Fixes (1-2 days) 🚀
*High impact, low effort*

| # | Change | Why It Matters | Impact |
|---|--------|---------------|--------|
| 1 | **Rotate all credentials** — new MongoDB password, Cloudinary key, Mapbox token, strong session secret | Current ones are exposed in Git history | 🔴 Security |
| 2 | **Add [.env](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/Projects/wanderLust/.env) to [.gitignore](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/Projects/wanderLust/.gitignore)** (already there) + create `.env.example` | Prevents future leaks, helps onboarding | 🟢 DX |
| 3 | **Fix [app.js](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/Projects/wanderLust/app.js) ordering** — move `app.listen()` to the bottom after all routes | Currently starts accepting traffic before routes are ready | 🟡 Reliability |
| 4 | **Add `helmet`** — `app.use(helmet())` | Adds 11+ security headers in one line | 🔴 Security |
| 5 | **Add `express-rate-limit`** on auth routes | Prevents brute-force login attempts | 🔴 Security |
| 6 | **Fix typo** `fallowedFormats` → `allowedFormats` in [cloudConfig.js](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/Projects/wanderLust/cloudConfig.js) | Currently not restricting upload formats at all | 🟡 Security |
| 7 | **Add `secure` and `sameSite` to session cookie** | Prevents cookie theft and CSRF partially | 🟡 Security |
| 8 | **Remove `console.log` statements** from controllers and init | Debug logs leak data in production | 🟢 Quality |
| 9 | **Remove unused deps** (`cookie-parser`, `razorpay`) | Reduces attack surface and bundle size | 🟢 Quality |
| 10 | **Add null checks** in [createListing](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/Projects/wanderLust/controllers/listing.js#30-47) for `req.file` and geocoding response | Prevents crashes on malformed requests | 🟡 Reliability |

