| 2 | **Use Cloudinary transformations** — serve resized thumbnails on index, full on show | Reduces image payload dramatically | 🟡 Performance |
| 3 | **Add Redis for sessions** instead of MongoDB | 10-50x faster session lookups | 🟡 Performance |
| 4 | **Implement cursor-based pagination** | More efficient than skip/limit at large offsets | 🟢 Performance |
| 5 | **Add response caching** — cache listing index for 60s | Reduces DB load significantly | 🟡 Performance |
| 6 | **Move Mapbox JS to show page only** | Don't load 200KB of map JS on pages without maps | 🟡 Performance |
| 7 | **Add compression middleware** | Reduces response size by 60-70% | 🟢 Performance |
| 8 | **Database connection pooling tuning** | Handle concurrent connections properly | 🟢 Reliability |
| 9 | **Implement WebSocket for real-time reviews** | Better UX for review updates | 🟢 Feature |
| 10 | **Add monitoring** — PM2, Winston logging, health check endpoint | Production observability | 🟡 DevOps |

